# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository AND on checkout.
#
# Git for Windows sets core.autocrlf=true at SYSTEM scope, so a Windows clone would otherwise
# get CRLF. That is not cosmetic here: CRLF shell scripts uploaded into a Linux container fail
# with `set: pipefail\r: invalid option name`, which is exactly the bug that cost this project
# a Modal deploy cycle. All 72 .sh files in the proto-tools install were affected.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Structure and data files: keep bytes exactly as-is.
*.pdb -text
*.cif -text
*.tif -text
*.jpg -text
*.gif -text
*.xlsx -text
